{"repositoryId":1111591844,"availability":"available","full":"Mhammadkhan17/Physical-AI-Humanoid-Robotics-Course","name":"Physical-AI-Humanoid-Robotics-Course","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-07T08:56:32Z","updated":"2026-10-15T09:52:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://physical-ai-humanoid-robotics-cours-zeta.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://physical-ai-humanoid-robotics-cours-zeta.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:49.405Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:49.405Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:49.405Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:20:49.405Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live site: physical-ai-humanoid-robotics-cours-zeta.vercel.app","An AI-native textbook on physical AI and humanoid robotics with a built-in RAG tutor: highlight any passage in a chapter, ask the chatbot about it, and get an answer grounded in the book's own content — streamed back as it is generated."],"features":["Selection-aware RAG tutor — questions can carry the reader's highlighted text and the current chapterid, so retrieval is scoped to the chapter being read.","Fully local retrieval — embeddings run in-process (ONNX all-MiniLM-L6-v2, 384-dim) and vectors live in a local Qdrant; the only remote call in the answer path is the LLM through OpenRouter.","Offline incremental ingestion — content hashes per MDX file mean unchanged chapters are skipped, edits are re-indexed, and deleted files are cleaned up.","Streaming answers — /api/chat returns a text/plain stream that the chatbot appends to token by token.","Personalization and Urdu translation — a quiz builds a learner profile that drives chapter rewrites; the translate action renders the chapter in Urdu (RTL) and leaves fenced code blocks untouched."],"sourceUrl":"https://git